.SH NAME
geni\-uploader\-listing\-shape \- print the JSON shape of profile document/photo listings
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B geni\-uploader listing\-shape
.BI "\-\-manifest " "MANIFEST"
.SH DESCRIPTION
Prints the JSON shape of the first page of each target profile's document and photo listings, for building the expected listing shapes used by plan. First pages only; no writes, no pagination.
.SH OPTIONS
